<section class="section services"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div class="faq-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Before you get started</div><h2>Practical questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Do all business automations need AI?</summary><p>No. Predictable tasks are often better handled with straightforward rules. We use AI where interpreting information, classifying a request, or drafting content adds value, with appropriate review.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if an automation fails?</summary><p>We define exception handling, notifications, and ownership as part of the scope. Testing covers missing information and common connection failures. Ongoing monitoring and maintenance are discussed before launch.</p></details><details><summary>How long does implementation take?</summary><p>Timing depends on tool access, the number of connections, data quality, and testing requirements. A focused workflow is planned before work starts; larger systems are delivered in phases with agreed milestones.</p></details><details><summary>Can you build with n8n?</summary><p>Yes. n8n is part of the SimpleTen automation toolkit. We choose the hosting approach and integrations based on your requirements, existing tools, and ability to support the system.</p></details></div></div></section><div style="height:70px" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Let’s make your next step simple</div><h2 data-reveal="words">A better business<br>starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us where work gets stuck. We’ll start with a free assessment and find the first useful step for your business.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:jesse@simpleten.ai?subject=SimpleTen%20business%20assessment&amp;body=Hi%20Jesse%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20Service%20Business%20Blueprint.%0A%0ABusiness%20name%3A%0AWebsite%3